## 2. Layer-by-Layer Responsibilities

| Layer | Responsibility | Key Technologies |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **UI Layer** | Declarative UI views. Must never execute data manipulation directly. | SwiftUI, `@Observable`, Environment |
| **ViewModel** | Manages UI state, transforms domain entities, guarantees thread safety via `@MainActor`. | Swift 5.9 `@Observable`, `@MainActor` |
| **Domain Layer** | Protocol-oriented pure Swift business rules. Independent of UIKit or SwiftUI. | Swift Protocols, Pure Structs |
| **Data Layer** | Single source of truth. Handles network requests, Keychain token persistence, and thread-safe caching. | URLSession, Swift `actor`, Keychain API |

