## Checklist for iOS PR Approval

- [ ] UI is 100% built with SwiftUI and supports Dynamic Type & VoiceOver accessibility.
- [ ] ViewModels use Swift 5.9 `@Observable` macro and `@MainActor` attribute.
- [ ] Repositories use Swift `actor` models for thread-safe memory caching.
- [ ] No completion handlers or `DispatchQueue.main.async` calls; code uses `async`/`await`.
- [ ] Sensitive tokens are stored in Keychain.
- [ ] Swift Testing or XCTest cases verify ViewModel state transitions.
- [ ] Zero compiler warnings with `SWIFT_STRICT_CONCURRENCY = complete`.
